em":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":88,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":89,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"twist"},{"n":90,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"boss"},{"n":91,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"breather"},{"n":92,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":93,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":94,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"twist"},{"n":95,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":96,"rating":8,"problem":"","fix":"","purpose":"finale"},{"n":97,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"teach"},{"n":98,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"teach"},{"n":99,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":100,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":101,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"twist"},{"n":102,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"boss"},{"n":103,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"breather"},{"n":104,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":105,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":106,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"twist"},{"n":107,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":108,"rating":8,"problem":"","fix":"","purpose":"finale"},{"n":109,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":110,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":111,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":112,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":113,"rating":8,"problem":"","fix":"","purpose":"twist"},{"n":114,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"boss"},{"n":115,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"breather"},{"n":116,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"practise"},{"n":117,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":118,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"twist"},{"n":119,"rating":7,"problem":"Fine.","fix":"None.","purpose":"combine"},{"n":120,"rating":8,"problem":"","fix":"","purpose":"finale"}],"summary":"Nonogram Atelier is a competent, well-paced 120-level set. Its mechanic chapters (void, stamp, colour-cross, smudged, cracked, chain) are introduced one at a time, and each chapter ends in a masterwork finale. The late-game casual win rates (about 53-70%) sit on the studio target. The main weaknesses are repetition and uneven aha. Chapters 2 and 3 rest on a few ideas (reach, touching-colour exact fits) that are restated across many near-identical animal and object silhouettes, and several practise and filler levels (L5, L9, L14-L17, L27, L29, L31-L33) add little. Weak spots to fix first: merge or replace the redundant colour exact-fit levels, make the reach levels isolate reach, and make sure each breather is clearly easier than its neighbours. The best levels (L10, L12, L23, L34, L37, L46, L53, L65, L70, L84, L113) show the intended quality: a single clear insight, a readable picture and a fair chain. That standard is not yet held across the whole set, so it is a good product but not yet at the level of Picross S. For a premium, calm nonogram this is a solid base, with consistency work still needed."}
